              "created": "2024-07-02T18:09:42.084000",
              "description": "This pulse takes a peak into the Alberta NDP party and their current breach situation. The (original) purpose of this pulse was to further identify and characterize issues relating to the (still) ongoing UAlberta breach and to see if the Alberta NDP were impacted. Prepared this pulse to present to them as a component of it's relevancy to their own infrastructure (e.g. highlighting the privacy, safety, security implications for their party) as it was 2 months ago. Was told my contacts would be on vacation until September. It now seems during that waiting time much of the party and it's leaders have been breached/affected by similar malware & infostealers. Still waiting?",
