              "description": "Mirai •\nCycBot. Hackers connected\nto targets phone intercepting calls. |\nHi Dennis, how the heck are you? Who are you? We connected targets former phone to a lawyer to become familiar with botnet experience. Time spent speaking to several fraudulent people who pretend to be people they are not. \n\nFrom our side: A factual account was given to a professional sounding female phone actor who answered call without giving name of law firm or her own name / title , listened for some time , few screening questions, no one in ‘ law firm’ didn’t know statutes of limitations.\n\nSad there was never a way for  target to contact find legitimate legal representation due to being in multiple botnets. \n Very disturbing. \n\n#colorado_government",
