              "created": "2025-10-15T18:54:43.205000",
              "description": "Injection, Crypt , ProRat , Tofsee and a version Mirai affecting Assurant and T-Mobile and me. There is truth to the tip I received. This is the 3rd time all of my networks went down , even my phone disconnected and phone number changed temporarily. \n\nJosh T found again. Online profile possibly staged. Stated he is a gamer , self trained in Lua, , CS major in Canada. He is a malicious hacker and streamer and probably an entity. Eric _E iCloud related. Found DoD & Mil hackers related. I haven’t taken the time to authenticate.. Very malicious and talented hackers attacking. I can’t ignore the .mil and DoD items that populated in previous pulses. \n \n[OTX Auto Populated-Trojan-gen-Glupteba, Danabot, Prorat, and other names have been identified as the names of those affected by the latest cyber-attack on the internet.]",
