              "description": "Strange. Person/s handling a monitored targeted past accounts was contacted to have old bills paid. Told individual had Argus Health Insurance that wouldn’t pay.\n\nIssues: • Individual wasn’t a client of vendor in 2024\n• Was never an Argus client.\n• Social engineering type call. Angry employee demanding copy of front and back of Health Care Insurance card for UH  payments for items purchased after approved prior authorization for in past purchases. \n• Gave an incredible amount of PHI over phone w/o appropriate new (or former) HIPPA standard verification.  • Angrily refused to provide billing # or requesters name.\n*United Health Care has paid ZERO bills. \n* \n(Auto populated - Anel arauchealth cam) | https://www.argushealth.com. Argus Health Systems is a healthcare technology company based in Kansas City, MO. Specializing in pharmacy benefit management ...",
