als.html Testimonials /a          a href= advanced techniques.html Advanced /a          a href= about.html About /a        /nav      /div    /header    div class= full height      h1 The To Do Method /h1      h5       Unlock your productivity potential       It s simple  effective  and guaranteed to change your life  maybe      /h5      button class= next  onclick= nextSection What is it /button    /div    div class= full height      div class= list        p span class= text white 1. /span  Make a list of things to do /p        p span class= text white 2. /span  Do some of the things on the list /p        p span class= text white 3. /span  Repeat /p      /div      div        button class= next  onclick= nextSection Do people like it /button      /div    /div    div class= full height      div class= quotes        p span class= text white This is the best agile methodology since 2025 /span br  Freddy /p        p span class= text white We didn t need 17 men at the top of a mountain to invent this method  women have been doing it for years /span br    Betty /p        p span class= text white I used to be a disorganized mess. Now  I m just a mess  but with a list /span br    Anonymous /p      /div      div        button class= next  onclick= nextSection FACK /button      /div    /div    div class= full height      div class= faq text white        div class= faq item          div class= faq question Q: What if it s on the list /div          div class= faq answer A:  span class= do it Do it /span /div        /div        div class= faq item          div class= faq question Q: What if it s not on the list /div          div class= faq answer A:  span class= dont do it Don t do it /span /div        /div        div class= faq item          div class= faq question Q: So  if it s on the list  should I do it /div          div class= faq answer A:  span class= do it Do it /span /div        /div        div class= faq item          div class= faq question Q: What if I don t want to 